> In organization, if we keep multiple accounts for multiple environments & projects:
1. If you have multiple accounts in AWS, its tough to manage them.
2. Dev Infra will be in dev-x aws account.
3. Prod Infra will be in prod-x aws account.
4. api Infra will be in api-x aws account.
5. Sandbox Infra will be in sandbox-x aws account.

> AWS Landing Zone - 
1. Will have a main account for a organization & inside that we will have multiple accounts tied.
2. In that main account, we will use a service called a AWS Landing Zone.
3. If you login to that main account, you will see all the accounts listed there.
4. You can switch between the accounts using AWS SSO.   

